{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15301304","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15301304","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1530130401:0":{"text":"因为我是雅库伯尔最会采花的人！我的花比平时丛林里能见到的好看得多！","source_cn":"因为我是雅库伯尔最会采花的人！我的花比平时丛林里能见到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA7B7AD9A779FC6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530130402:0":{"text":"要是想向心爱的姑娘求偶，拿上我的花，肯定没错！","source_cn":"要是想向心爱的姑娘求偶，拿上我的花，肯定没错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCABAF07C2AA14E10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530130403:0":{"text":"……根本看不出有什么特别的啊，不过是一束随处可见的花。","source_cn":"……根本看不出有什么特别的啊，不过是一束随处可见的花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x559B2609A8B3CDAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530130404:0":{"text":"我还是自己去采一束好了，至少也能显得我很有诚意！","source_cn":"我还是自己去采一束好了，至少也能显得我很有诚意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD35408049435B7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:羊角":{"text":"羊角","source":"羊角","status":"source"},"speaker:昂":{"text":"昂","source":"昂","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}